                                                                                                                                                                                                            < div class="p-3 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg flex justify-between items-center text-sm" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                <span class="font-medium text-emerald-900" > Estimated Payout to Seller: </span>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < span id = "display-payout" class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-700" >₹60.00 </span>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < button onclick = "publishListing()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Publish Scrap Listing
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </button>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </section>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < !--TAB 2: BUYER VIEW(MAP & NEARBY LISTINGS)-- >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <section id="tab-buyer" class="hidden" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4 md:col-span-1 flex flex-col h-[600px]" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <span>🚚</span> Nearby Scrap Listings
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </h2>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3" > Live listings within 15 km of your depot.</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < div id = "listings-container" class="space-y-3 overflow-y-auto flex-1 pr-1" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400" > Loading listings nearby...</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col h-[600px]" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-2" > Live Map Discovery </h3>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < div id = "map" class="flex-1 rounded-lg border" > </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </section>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < !--TAB 3: DOORSTEP VERIFICATION & SETTLEMENT-- >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <section id="tab-settlement" class="hidden" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <span>⚖️</span> Doorstep Weighing & OTP Settlement
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6" > Mitigates scale tampering, tare bag weight, and material misidentification.</p>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < div class="space-y-4" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > Active Order ID </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < input type = "number" id = "order-id" value = "1" class="w-full border rounded-lg p-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 font-mono" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < div >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > Seller Handover OTP </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < input type = "text" id = "order-otp" placeholder = "4-digit OTP" class="w-full border rounded-lg p-2 text-sm font-mono tracking-widest text-center font-bold" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > Gross Weight on Scale(kg) </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < input type = "number" id = "gross-weight" step = "0.1" placeholder = "e.g. 10.5" class="w-full border rounded-lg p-2 text-sm font-bold" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < div >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > Container Tare Deduction </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < select id = "tare-type" class="w-full border rounded-lg p-2 text-sm bg-slate-50" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <option value="none" > No Container(0.0 kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < option value = "gunny_sack" > Gunny Sack(-0.5 kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < option value = "plastic_crate" > Plastic Crate(-1.5 kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </select>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < div >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > Upload Scale Screen Photo(Optional OCR Check) </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < input type = "file" id = "scale-file" accept = "image/*" class="block w-full text-sm file:mr-4 file:py-1.5 file:px-3 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:bg-indigo-50 file:text-indigo-700 hover:file:bg-indigo-100 border rounded-lg cursor-pointer" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < div >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1" > On - Site Material Grade Reclassification(If Misidentified) </label>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < select id = "adjusted-cat" class="w-full border rounded-lg p-2 text-sm bg-slate-50" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <option value="" > Keep Original Seller Category </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < option value = "1" > Reclassify as Cardboard (₹12 / kg)</option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < option value = "2" > Reclassify as PET Plastic(₹18.5 / kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            < option value = "3" > Reclassify as Aluminum (₹110 / kg)</option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < option value = "4" > Reclassify as E - Waste(₹75 / kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    < option value = "5" > Reclassify as Iron Scrap(₹28 / kg) </option>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </select>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        < button onclick = "completeDoorstepSettlement()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow" >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Verify Weight & Release Payout
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </button>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                < !--Result Card-- >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div id="settlement-result" class="hidden p-4 rounded-lg border bg-slate-50 text-sm space-y-1" > </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </section>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </main>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        <script>
let map = null;
let markers = [];
let currentBase64 = null;
let currentScaleBase64 = null;

// Convert file to base64
document.getElementById('scrap-file').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
    const file = e.target.files[0];
    if (!file) return;
    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = () => { currentBase64 = reader.result; };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
});

document.getElementById('scale-file').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
    const file = e.target.files[0];
    if (!file) return;
    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = () => { currentScaleBase64 = reader.result; };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
});

function switchTab(tab) {
    ['seller', 'buyer', 'settlement'].forEach(t => {
        document.getElementById(`tab-${t}`).classList.add('hidden');
        document.getElementById(`btn-${t}`).classList.remove('bg-emerald-800');
        document.getElementById(`btn-${t}`).classList.add('bg-emerald-600');
    });
    document.getElementById(`tab-${tab}`).classList.remove('hidden');
    document.getElementById(`btn-${tab}`).classList.add('bg-emerald-800');

    if (tab === 'buyer') {
        setTimeout(initMapAndLoadListings, 100);
    }
}

async function runAiClassification() {
    if (!currentBase64) {
        alert('Please pick an image file first.');
        return;
    }
    const btn = document.getElementById('btn-ai-scan');
    btn.innerText = 'Scanning with Gemini 2.5 Flash...';
    btn.disabled = true;

    try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/ai/classify', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ imageBase64: currentBase64 })
        });
        const data = await res.json();
        if (data.success) {
            document.getElementById('listing-title').value = data.analysis.suggested_title;
            document.getElementById('listing-weight').value = data.analysis.estimated_weight_kg;
            document.getElementById('listing-category').value = data.category_id;
            document.getElementById('display-payout').innerText = `₹${data.suggested_payout}`;
        }
    } catch (err) {
        alert('Error contacting AI service: ' + err.message);
    } finally {
        btn.innerText = '✨ Scan & Auto-Fill with Platform AI';
        btn.disabled = false;
    }
}

async function publishListing() {
    const title = document.getElementById('listing-title').value || 'Mixed Scrap Material';
    const category_id = parseInt(document.getElementById('listing-category').value);
    const estimated_weight = parseFloat(document.getElementById('listing-weight').value);
    const landmark = document.getElementById('listing-landmark').value;
    const gate_instructions = document.getElementById('listing-instructions').value;

    const res = await fetch('/api/seller/listings', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
            category_id,
            title,
            estimated_weight,
            landmark,
            gate_instructions,
            asking_price: estimated_weight * 15,
            latitude: 12.9716,
            longitude: 77.5946
        })
    });

    const data = await res.json();
    if (data.success) {
        alert('Listing published successfully! Buyers within 15 km can now discover it on their map.');
        switchTab('buyer');
    }
}

function initMapAndLoadListings() {
    if (!map) {
        map = L.map('map').setView([12.9716, 77.5946], 13);
        L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {
            maxZoom: 19,
            attribution: '© OpenStreetMap'
        }).addTo(map);
    }
    fetchNearbyListings();
}

async function fetchNearbyListings() {
    const container = document.getElementById('listings-container');
    container.innerHTML = '<p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Loading nearby scrap...</p>';
    markers.forEach(m => map.removeLayer(m));
    markers = [];

    const res = await fetch('/api/buyer/nearby-listings?lng=77.5900&lat=12.9700&radius=15000');
    const data = await res.json();

    if (!data.success || data.listings.length === 0) {
        container.innerHTML = '<p class="text-sm text-slate-400">No open listings found within 15 km.</p>';
        return;
    }

    container.innerHTML = '';
    data.listings.forEach(l => {
        // Map Marker
        const marker = L.marker([l.latitude, l.longitude]).addTo(map)
            .bindPopup(`<b>${l.title}</b><br>${l.category_name} (~${l.estimated_weight} kg)`);
        markers.push(marker);

        // Sidebar Card
        const card = document.createElement('div');
        card.className = 'border rounded-lg p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 transition';
        card.innerHTML = `
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800">${l.title}</h4>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded">${l.category_name}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">Distance: <b>${l.distance_meters}m</b> away • Est: <b>${l.estimated_weight} kg</b></p>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-white p-2 rounded border mb-2">
            📍 <b>Last 50m:</b> ${l.landmark} (${l.gate_instructions})
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <button onclick="schedulePickup(${l.id})" class="flex-1 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold py-1.5 rounded">
              Accept & Schedule
            </button>
            <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=${l.latitude},${l.longitude}" target="_blank" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-xs rounded font-medium">
              🗺️ Nav
            </a>
          </div>
        `;
        container.appendChild(card);
    });
}

async function schedulePickup(listingId) {
    const res = await fetch('/api/buyer/schedule-pickup', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ listing_id: listingId })
    });
    const data = await res.json();
    if (data.success) {
        alert(`Pickup Scheduled!\nOrder ID: ${data.order.id}\nSeller OTP for Demo: ${data.order.otp_code}`);
        document.getElementById('order-id').value = data.order.id;
        document.getElementById('order-otp').value = data.order.otp_code;
        switchTab('settlement');
    }
}

async function completeDoorstepSettlement() {
    const order_id = parseInt(document.getElementById('order-id').value);
    const otp_code = document.getElementById('order-otp').value;
    const gross_weight = parseFloat(document.getElementById('gross-weight').value);
    const tare_type = document.getElementById('tare-type').value;
    const adjusted_category_id = document.getElementById('adjusted-cat').value || null;

    if (!order_id || !otp_code || !gross_weight) {
        alert('Please fill in Order ID, OTP, and Gross Weight.');
        return;
    }

    const res = await fetch('/api/buyer/complete-pickup', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
            order_id,
            otp_code,
            gross_weight,
            tare_type,
            scale_image_base64: currentScaleBase64,
            adjusted_category_id: adjusted_category_id ? parseInt(adjusted_category_id) : null
        })
    });

    const data = await res.json();
    const resultBox = document.getElementById('settlement-result');
    resultBox.classList.remove('hidden');

    if (data.success) {
        resultBox.className = 'p-4 rounded-lg border bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-950 text-sm space-y-1.5';
        resultBox.innerHTML = `
          <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-emerald-800">✅ Payout & Weighing Finalized</h4>
          <p>Scrap Material: <b>${data.summary.category_name}</b></p>
          <p>Gross Weight: <b>${data.summary.gross_weight_kg} kg</b> | Tare Deducted: <b>-${data.summary.tare_deducted_kg} kg</b></p>
          <p>Billable Net Weight: <b>${data.summary.billable_net_weight_kg} kg</b> (@ ₹${data.summary.rate_per_kg}/kg)</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-700 pt-1">Total Payout to Seller: ₹${data.summary.final_payout_inr}</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 pt-1 border-t">AI Scale Check: <b>${data.summary.scale_verification}</b> (${data.summary.verification_notes})</p>
        `;
    } else {
        resultBox.className = 'p-4 rounded-lg border bg-rose-50 text-rose-950 text-sm space-y-1';
        resultBox.innerHTML = `<h4 class="font-bold text-rose-700">❌ Error</h4><p>${data.error}</p>`;
    }
}
</script>
    </body>
    </html>
7. Step - by - Step Execution Guide
Install Dependencies:

Bash
npm install
Start PostgreSQL & ensure PostGIS is installed:
Ensure PostgreSQL is running locally on port 5432 with a database named recycledb(matching your.env connection string).

Launch the platform:

Bash
npm start
Test the Complete Workflow in Your Browser:
Open http://localhost:5000:

Seller Tab: Pick an image of cardboard or scrap, tap "Scan & Auto-Fill with Platform AI", and click "Publish Scrap Listing".

Buyer Tab: The interactive Leaflet map will render the exact pin and last - 50m gate instructions.Click "Accept & Schedule".

Settlement Tab: Enter the Gross Weight on the scale(e.g., 10.5 kg), choose a Tare deduction(e.g., Gunny Sack - 0.5 kg), enter the verification OTP, and click "Verify Weight & Release Payout" to complete the end - to - end transaction.